{"seq":1,"slug":"setup-and-lifecycle","title":"setup 与生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/composition-api/setup-and-lifecycle","wordCount":614,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"setup-与生命周期\">setup 与生命周期</h1><h2 id=\"composition-api-的入口\">Composition API 的入口</h2><p><code>setup</code> 是 Vue 3 Composition API 的核心入口。它在组件实例创建之后、<code>beforeCreate</code> 之前执行，是所有组合式逻辑的起点。在 <code>&lt;script setup&gt;</code> 语法糖中，整个 <code>&lt;script&gt;</code> 块就是 <code>setup</code> 函数的体。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph Lifecycle[&quot;组件生命周期&quot;]&#10;        direction TB&#10;        A[&quot;new Component()&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;setup()&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt; C[&quot;beforeCreate&quot;]&#10;        C --&gt; D[&quot;created&quot;]&#10;        D --&gt; E[&quot;beforeMount&quot;]&#10;        E --&gt; F[&quot;mounted&quot;]&#10;        F --&gt; G[&quot;beforeUpdate&quot;]&#10;        G --&gt; H[&quot;updated&quot;]&#10;        F --&gt; I[&quot;beforeUnmount&quot;]&#10;        I --&gt; J[&quot;unmounted&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph Lifecycle[\"组件生命周期\"]\n        direction TB\n        A[\"new Component()\"] --&gt; B[\"setup()\"]\n        B --&gt; C[\"beforeCreate\"]\n        C --&gt; D[\"created\"]\n        D --&gt; E[\"beforeMount\"]\n        E --&gt; F[\"mounted\"]\n        F --&gt; G[\"beforeUpdate\"]\n        G --&gt; H[\"updated\"]\n        F --&gt; I[\"beforeUnmount\"]\n        I --&gt; J[\"unmounted\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>setup</strong>：Composition API 的入口函数，在组件实例创建后、<code>beforeCreate</code> 之前执行，是注册所有组合式逻辑的地方。</li>\n<li><strong><code>&lt;script setup&gt;</code></strong>：<code>setup</code> 的编译时语法糖，顶层绑定自动暴露给模板，无运行时返回对象的开销。</li>\n<li><strong>生命周期钩子</strong>：以 <code>on*</code> 前缀命名的注册函数，只能在 <code>setup</code> 上下文中调用，负责挂载、更新、卸载各阶段的副作用。</li>\n<li><strong>执行顺序</strong>：父子组件遵循「外→内挂载、内→外卸载」，理解它是资源管理与调试的前提。</li>\n<li><strong>组件实例上下文</strong>：<code>getCurrentInstance</code> 暴露的内部实例，属于高级/库开发场景，生产代码优先用 <code>provide</code>/<code>inject</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"setup-函数\">setup 函数</h2><h3 id=\"基本形式\">基本形式</h3><p><code>setup</code> 函数接收两个参数：<code>props</code> 和 <code>context</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { ref, onMounted } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default {&#10;  props: {&#10;    title: String,&#10;  },&#10;  setup(props, { attrs, slots, emit, expose }) {&#10;    const count = ref&lt;number&gt;(0);&#10;&#10;    function increment() {&#10;      count.value++;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    onMounted(() =&gt; {&#10;      console.log(`${props.title} 已挂载`);&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    return { count, increment };&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ref, onMounted } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  props: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    title: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  setup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">props</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">attrs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">slots</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">emit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">expose</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> increment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      count.value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    onMounted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">props</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">title</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} 已挂载`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { count, increment };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"script-setup-语法糖\">script setup 语法糖</h3><p><code>&lt;script setup&gt;</code> 是 <code>setup</code> 函数的编译时语法糖，更简洁且性能更好：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;import { ref, onMounted } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const props = defineProps&lt;{ title: string }&gt;();&#10;const emit = defineEmits&lt;{ (e: &#39;update&#39;, value: number): void }&gt;();&#10;&#10;const count = ref&lt;number&gt;(0);&#10;&#10;function increment() {&#10;  count.value++;&#10;  emit(&#39;update&#39;, count.value);&#10;}&#10;&#10;onMounted(() =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(`${props.title} 已挂载`);&#10;});&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { ref, onMounted } from 'vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const props = defineProps&#x3C;{ title: string }>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const emit = defineEmits&#x3C;{ (e: 'update', value: number): void }>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const count = ref&#x3C;number>(0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function increment() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  count.value++;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  emit('update', count.value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log(`${props.title} 已挂载`);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th><code>setup()</code> 函数</th>\n<th><code>&lt;script setup&gt;</code></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语法</td>\n<td>返回对象暴露给模板</td>\n<td>顶层绑定自动暴露</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>运行时创建返回对象</td>\n<td>编译优化，无额外开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>props</td>\n<td>函数参数</td>\n<td><code>defineProps</code> 宏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>emits</td>\n<td>context.emit</td>\n<td><code>defineEmits</code> 宏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TypeScript</td>\n<td>需要 <code>defineComponent</code></td>\n<td>原生支持泛型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"生命周期钩子\">生命周期钩子</h2><p>Vue 3 提供了一组 <code>on*</code> 前缀的生命周期钩子函数，只能在 <code>setup</code> 中调用：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Creation[&quot;创建阶段&quot;]&#10;        S[&quot;setup&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Mounting[&quot;挂载阶段&quot;]&#10;        BM[&quot;onBeforeMount&quot;]&#10;        M[&quot;onMounted&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Updating[&quot;更新阶段&quot;]&#10;        BU[&quot;onBeforeUpdate&quot;]&#10;        U[&quot;onUpdated&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Unmounting[&quot;卸载阶段&quot;]&#10;        BUM[&quot;onBeforeUnmount&quot;]&#10;        UM[&quot;onUnmounted&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    Creation --&gt; Mounting --&gt; Updating --&gt; Unmounting\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Creation[\"创建阶段\"]\n        S[\"setup\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Mounting[\"挂载阶段\"]\n        BM[\"onBeforeMount\"]\n        M[\"onMounted\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Updating[\"更新阶段\"]\n        BU[\"onBeforeUpdate\"]\n        U[\"onUpdated\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Unmounting[\"卸载阶段\"]\n        BUM[\"onBeforeUnmount\"]\n        UM[\"onUnmounted\"]\n    end\n    Creation --&gt; Mounting --&gt; Updating --&gt; Unmounting</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import {&#10;  onBeforeMount,&#10;  onMounted,&#10;  onBeforeUpdate,&#10;  onUpdated,&#10;  onBeforeUnmount,&#10;  onUnmounted,&#10;  onActivated,&#10;  onDeactivated,&#10;  onErrorCaptured,&#10;} from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;onBeforeMount(() =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;DOM 即将挂载&#39;);&#10;});&#10;&#10;onMounted(() =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;DOM 已挂载，可访问 DOM 元素&#39;);&#10;});&#10;&#10;onBeforeUpdate(() =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;响应式数据变化，DOM 即将更新&#39;);&#10;});&#10;&#10;onUpdated(() =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;DOM 已更新&#39;);&#10;});&#10;&#10;onBeforeUnmount(() =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;组件即将卸载，清理定时器/监听器&#39;);&#10;});&#10;&#10;onUnmounted(() =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;组件已卸载&#39;);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  onBeforeMount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  onMounted,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  onBeforeUpdate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  onUpdated,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  onBeforeUnmount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  onUnmounted,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  onActivated,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  onDeactivated,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  onErrorCaptured,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onBeforeMount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DOM 即将挂载'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onMounted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DOM 已挂载，可访问 DOM 元素'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onBeforeUpdate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'响应式数据变化，DOM 即将更新'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onUpdated</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DOM 已更新'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onBeforeUnmount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'组件即将卸载，清理定时器/监听器'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onUnmounted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'组件已卸载'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"options-api-vs-composition-api-钩子对照\">Options API vs Composition API 钩子对照</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Options API</th>\n<th>Composition API</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>beforeCreate</code></td>\n<td><code>setup()</code> 本身</td>\n<td>setup 在 beforeCreate 之前执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>created</code></td>\n<td><code>setup()</code> 本身</td>\n<td>setup 中的同步代码等同于 created</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>beforeMount</code></td>\n<td><code>onBeforeMount</code></td>\n<td>DOM 挂载前</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>mounted</code></td>\n<td><code>onMounted</code></td>\n<td>DOM 挂载后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>beforeUpdate</code></td>\n<td><code>onBeforeUpdate</code></td>\n<td>DOM 更新前</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>updated</code></td>\n<td><code>onUpdated</code></td>\n<td>DOM 更新后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>beforeUnmount</code></td>\n<td><code>onBeforeUnmount</code></td>\n<td>卸载前</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>unmounted</code></td>\n<td><code>onUnmounted</code></td>\n<td>卸载后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>activated</code></td>\n<td><code>onActivated</code></td>\n<td>KeepAlive 激活</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>deactivated</code></td>\n<td><code>onDeactivated</code></td>\n<td>KeepAlive 停用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>errorCaptured</code></td>\n<td><code>onErrorCaptured</code></td>\n<td>捕获后代错误</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"执行顺序\">执行顺序</h2><p>理解父子组件的生命周期执行顺序对于调试和资源管理至关重要：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant P as 父组件&#10;    participant C as 子组件&#10;&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;P: setup&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;P: onBeforeMount&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;C: setup&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;C: onBeforeMount&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;C: onMounted&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;P: onMounted&#10;    Note over P,C: 更新阶段&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;P: onBeforeUpdate&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;C: onBeforeUpdate&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;C: onUpdated&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;P: onUpdated&#10;    Note over P,C: 卸载阶段&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;P: onBeforeUnmount&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;C: onBeforeUnmount&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;C: onUnmounted&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;P: onUnmounted\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant P as 父组件\n    participant C as 子组件\n\n    P-&gt;&gt;P: setup\n    P-&gt;&gt;P: onBeforeMount\n    C-&gt;&gt;C: setup\n    C-&gt;&gt;C: onBeforeMount\n    C-&gt;&gt;C: onMounted\n    P-&gt;&gt;P: onMounted\n    Note over P,C: 更新阶段\n    P-&gt;&gt;P: onBeforeUpdate\n    C-&gt;&gt;C: onBeforeUpdate\n    C-&gt;&gt;C: onUpdated\n    P-&gt;&gt;P: onUpdated\n    Note over P,C: 卸载阶段\n    P-&gt;&gt;P: onBeforeUnmount\n    C-&gt;&gt;C: onBeforeUnmount\n    C-&gt;&gt;C: onUnmounted\n    P-&gt;&gt;P: onUnmounted</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"getcurrentinstance\">getCurrentInstance</h2><p><code>getCurrentInstance</code> 用于获取当前组件实例，主要用于库开发和高级场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { getCurrentInstance, onMounted } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const instance = getCurrentInstance();&#10;&#10;onMounted(() =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(instance?.proxy?.$el);&#10;  console.log(instance?.appContext.config.globalProperties);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { getCurrentInstance, onMounted } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> instance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getCurrentInstance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onMounted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(instance?.proxy?.$el);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(instance?.appContext.config.globalProperties);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>getCurrentInstance</code> 只能在 <code>setup</code> 或生命周期钩子中调用。在生产代码中应尽量避免使用它，优先通过 <code>inject</code> / <code>provide</code> 传递上下文。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>setup</code> 是 Composition API 的入口，在 <code>beforeCreate</code> 之前执行</li>\n<li><code>&lt;script setup&gt;</code> 是编译时语法糖，顶层变量自动暴露给模板，性能更优</li>\n<li>生命周期钩子使用 <code>on*</code> 前缀函数，只能在 <code>setup</code> 上下文中注册</li>\n<li>父子组件遵循 <strong>外→内挂载、内→外卸载</strong> 的执行顺序</li>\n<li><code>getCurrentInstance</code> 用于高级场景，生产代码中应优先使用 <code>provide</code>/<code>inject</code></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"setup 与生命周期","id":"setup-与生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"Composition API 的入口","id":"composition-api-的入口"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"setup 函数","id":"setup-函数"},{"level":3,"text":"基本形式","id":"基本形式"},{"level":3,"text":"script setup 语法糖","id":"script-setup-语法糖"},{"level":2,"text":"生命周期钩子","id":"生命周期钩子"},{"level":3,"text":"Options API vs Composition API 钩子对照","id":"options-api-vs-composition-api-钩子对照"},{"level":2,"text":"执行顺序","id":"执行顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"getCurrentInstance","id":"getcurrentinstance"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"响应式陷阱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/reactivity-system/reactivity-pitfalls"},"next":{"title":"Composables 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/composition-api/composables-patterns"}}